    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: 'Usually 3 or 4 players.',
      deck: '35 cards: A, K, Q, J, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6. **Note**: The Ace of Spades is usually removed, making the King of Spades the highest spade.',
      equipment: '35 cards: A, K, Q, J, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6. **Note**: The Ace of Spades is usually removed, making the King of Spades the highest spade.',
      dealing: 'Dealer deals 5 cards to each player (in batches of 3 then 2). The winner of the previous hand deals next.',
    },
    turnFlow: '1. Players must follow suit if possible.\n2. Highest card of the suit led wins the trick.\n3. Winner of a trick leads the next.\n4. **The Last Trick**: Only the points from the last one, two, or three tricks matter.',
