    exampleHands: [
      'Opening deal: 2-4 player(s), 5 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in deal; dealer may use deal before play.',
      'Scoring check: - **2 points**: Win the last trick with a 7.\n- **4 points**: Win the last TWO tricks, both with 7s.\n- **6 points**: Win the last THREE tricks, all with 7s (nearly impossible).\n- **1 point**: Win the last trick with any other card. Expected outcome: Win the final trick of the hand. If you win it with a 7, you score higher bonus points..',
